! Changelog

|!Version |!Date |!Changes |
|0.1.31 |2026-07-09 |`<$file-dropzone>` now layers over a `<$droppable>`: non-file drops (tiddler/URL) bubble instead of being swallowed, and a new `tabindex` attribute makes the zone focusable for clipboard paste. Additive; existing consumers unaffected |
|0.1.30 |2026-05-18 |New `file-ops.js` library (`cleanEmptyDirs`, `deleteGenerated`, `renameGenerated`, `deleteDerived`, `renameDerived`) extracted from the delete/rename routes, with tests for the nested `_derived/` case. Additive (Phase 0 of consolidation) |
|0.1.29 |2026-05-17 |8 new HTTP-level specs covering the three POST routes' validation paths (400/415/403) |
|0.1.28 |2026-05-15 |Delete-confirm modal: move Cancel / Delete-anyway into the modal `footer:` (no duplicate Close), drop the inline `<$navigator>` that ate `tm-close-tiddler`, delete directly via `$action-deletetiddler` |
|0.1.27 |2026-05-15 |Hotfix for 0.1.26: thumbnails rendered literal `{{{` (a `{{{filter}}}` isn't evaluated in positional macro args). Dropped the params from `fu-att-tile-img` (reads caller scope); added render-level tests for all tile shapes |
|0.1.26 |2026-05-15 |`fu-render-media-grid` gains opt-in draggable tiles, delete-mode dispatch and an extra-actions hook, plus always-on EXIF-portrait sizing; priv-app adopts it and drops its own grid |
|0.1.25 |2026-05-15 |`.eml` parents render Outlook-style in the media-modal like `.msg`; new `fu-att-email-artifact(att)` centralises the `.msg`/`.eml` → `.email` mapping; label falls back to filename when subject is blank |
|0.1.24 |2026-05-14 |Allow `message/rfc822` (.eml), routed to the `email/` subfolder; pairs with msg-import ≥ 0.1.7 |
|0.1.23 |2026-05-14 |New reusable `fu-render-media-grid` + `fu-media-modal` components (thumbnailed grid with per-tile copy/open/delete/describe, type-switched modal); appify-safe via inline navigators; tests for label/href/section filters |
|0.1.22 |2026-05-14 |Delete-confirm modal: fix literal `<$text>` render (was backtick-wrapped). Rejected uploads now raise a `tm-notify` toast instead of failing silently |
|0.1.21 |2026-05-14 |Artifact cascade made transitive (delete/rename walk `_artifact_source` to any depth). New delete-confirm modal for `_canonical_uri` tiddlers listing the full cascade + backlinks; toggle via `$:/config/rimir/file-upload/confirm-deletes` |
|0.1.20 |2026-05-13 |Allow `application/vnd.ms-outlook` (→ `email/`); parent rename also renames the `_derived/<basename>/` dir; extension-sniff fallback for empty-MIME drops fixes Outlook drag-and-drop |
|0.1.19 |2026-04-27 |Declare soft-dependents `doc-template`, `file-pipeline` |
|0.1.18 |2026-04-14 |Video body template: inline player with thumbnail-first cascade, quality selector and resizable wrapper; video metadata via `ffprobe` |
|0.1.17 |2026-04-14 |Binary upload route (`/api/file-upload-binary`): streams raw file, no base64/size limit; upload progress overlay; `video/*` → `videos/`; fix `deleteDerived` for non-default locations |
|0.1.16 |2026-04-09 |Pass dropzone `prop-system-prompt`/`prop-provider`/`prop-model` to the pipeline client for LLM step overrides |
|0.1.15 |2026-04-09 |file-pipeline integration: `<$file-dropzone>` auto-detects the plugin and triggers `pipeline="auto"`; new `pipeline` attribute; `upload.js` skips `runProcessor()` when file-pipeline is installed |
|0.1.14 |2026-04-08 |Fix rename: preserve file directory instead of re-routing by MIME; derive thumbnail URI from canonical URI; use last title segment as filename |
|0.1.13 |2026-04-08 |Add test coverage: uri-resolver, upload/delete/rename validation, dropzone (44→100 specs) |
|0.1.12 |2026-04-07 |Cleanup: `\define` → `\function` for thumb-state; palette variables instead of hardcoded colours |
|v0.1.11 |2026-04-07 |New `target-prefix` attribute: inserts a path prefix between subfolder and filename, exposed to the action string |
|v0.1.10 |2026-04-07 |EXIF extraction from images via ImageMagick, mapped to fields (date, camera, dimensions, GPS, exposure, lens); global + per-location mapping; on by default |
|v0.1.9 |2026-04-07 |Fix thumbnail cascade ordering; skip draft tiddlers in file cleanup; drop redundant `all[current]` from the cascade filter |
|v0.1.8 |2026-04-07 |Location registry: multi-location support with writable flag, `uri-resolver` library, artifact cascade, settings UI, `location` attribute, `serve-location` route; optional scattered-binaries/llm-connect integration |
|v0.1.7 |2026-03-27 |Remove phantom file-paths filter from docs; dedupe dropzone helpers; bundle default media-types shadow |
|v0.1.6 |2026-03-15 |Null guards on th-saving/th-renaming hooks |
|v0.1.5 |2026-03-15 |Add `name` field to plugin.info |
|v0.1.4 |2026-03-15 |Add regression tests, CI test gate, helpers library |
|v0.1.3 |2026-03-15 |Fix th-deleting-tiddler hook to return the tiddler (preserve hook chain); null guard for undefined upstream returns |
|v0.1.2 |2026-03-12 |Settings UI media-types section; fix missing config rejecting all uploads (415); quote paths so filenames with spaces thumbnail |
|v0.1.1 |2026-03-06 |Standardise plugin tabs; replace license.tid with LICENSE.md.meta sidecar |
|v0.1.0 |2026 |Initial release |
